1
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,620
[A Good Day to Ascend]

2
00:01:55,140 --> 00:02:03,450
[Previously on A Good Day to Ascend]

3
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:55,919
I knew

4
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:58,180
Xu Ying wasn't an ordinary snake hunter.

5
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:00,040
He's actually cultivating.

6
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,949
My name is recorded in both the
Phantom Capital and the Imperial Court.

7
00:02:02,950 --> 00:02:05,189
Killing me would be an offense against...

8
00:02:05,190 --> 00:02:05,770
[Slaying the deity]

9
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:07,180
Issue my order.

10
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,478
Capture Xu Ying with all your might.

11
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:11,400
Go to hell!

12
00:02:12,450 --> 00:02:13,319
Lord Wei Chu,

13
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,320
he's still alive.

14
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,679
If my Elephant Force Bull Fist

15
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,078
breaks through to the sixth level,

16
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:18,799
I won't have to fear Ding Quan.

17
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,560
Pursuers!

18
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:21,078
Such a massive disturbance...

19
00:02:21,079 --> 00:02:22,059
The Phantom River has changed its course!

20
00:02:22,060 --> 00:02:24,120
It's crossing into the mortal world!

21
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:27,800
[Episode 4:
The Phantom River Changes Course]

22
00:02:29,670 --> 00:02:31,169
The Immortal Path

23
00:02:31,170 --> 00:02:32,320
and the Human Path

24
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:34,770
each have their own merits and flaws.

25
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:39,020
Immortals stand above heaven and earth,

26
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:41,630
bestowing blessings upon all beings;

27
00:02:42,590 --> 00:02:45,610
humans devote themselves
to serving immortals

28
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:48,360
and uphold the order of rank.

29
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:54,120
This is the cycle of Heaven's Way,

30
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:57,710
and it must not be disrupted.

31
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,859
We slaughtered an entire city
in the Landu State,

32
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:26,559
drawing the Plague Deity down
to the mortal world.

33
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:29,840
If this goes on, the mortal world
will be plunged into misery.

34
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:30,880
[Qi cultivators: Lady Thirteenth
and Young Master Xiang]

35
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,119
If the Plague Deity doesn't descend
to the mortal world,

36
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,439
how could the Phantom River
change its course?

37
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,440
How could the Phantom Realm invade?

38
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:42,880
And how could the legendary sealed place
be unsealed?

39
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:44,240
But...

40
00:03:44,890 --> 00:03:48,130
Lady Thirteenth,
you're simply too soft-hearted.

41
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,640
If His plan succeeds,

42
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:53,710
Qi cultivators will rise again.

43
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:56,720
A mere few mortal lives

44
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:58,800
are nothing to worry about.

45
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:03,460
[The Landu State]

46
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,040
Move aside!

47
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,120
Move aside!

48
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,640
Get out of my way!

49
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,440
My lord!

50
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,200
My lord, save me!

51
00:04:41,490 --> 00:04:42,890
My lord!

52
00:05:05,990 --> 00:05:07,250
It's the Mountain God.

53
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,560
He's already caught up to us so soon.

54
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:14,780
Stone Mountain God.

55
00:05:14,990 --> 00:05:16,990
So it's Lord Wei, the Prison Warden.

56
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:20,030
Lord Wei, have you come
to my Stone Mountain

57
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,080
for that Xu Ying?

58
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,960
You already know the answer.

59
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:30,220
These two are at odds with each other.

60
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:35,559
With the Phantom River
changing its course,

61
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,360
we are all facing a catastrophe.

62
00:05:38,570 --> 00:05:39,450
Lord Wei,

63
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:42,800
if we fight each other,
we'll only both suffer losses.

64
00:05:43,030 --> 00:05:44,030
What do you think?

65
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:46,460
With disaster upon us,

66
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,280
we should indeed help each other.

67
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,520
After you.

68
00:05:53,230 --> 00:05:54,390
After you.

69
00:06:01,060 --> 00:06:02,639
With the Phantom River
changing its course,

70
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:04,440
we are all facing a catastrophe.

71
00:06:05,130 --> 00:06:06,930
Lord Wei, Stone Mountain God,

72
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:10,499
if we fight each other,
all three of us will only suffer losses.

73
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:11,580
What do you think?

74
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:25,460
Xu Ying, the criminal.

75
00:06:25,610 --> 00:06:27,410
Do you recognize this official?

76
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,280
Lord Wei,

77
00:06:28,390 --> 00:06:29,599
I don't have any money to give you.

78
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,319
You insolent commoner,

79
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:33,139
I can tell at a glance
whether you have any silver on you.

80
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:36,100
However, your crime is too serious.

81
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,760
I cannot pardon you.

82
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:41,319
As long as you want my life,
not my money, that's fine.

83
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,439
If you want my life,

84
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,720
I'll beat you to death.

85
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:45,489
But if you want my money,

86
00:06:45,490 --> 00:06:47,359
I really don't want to give it to you.

87
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,760
Xu the Great Benefactor,

88
00:06:48,860 --> 00:06:52,120
you were born with a talent
for getting yourself executed.

89
00:06:52,270 --> 00:06:53,679
Xu the Great Benefactor?

90
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,869
Xu the Great Benefactor,
the snake hunter.

91
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:57,850
That name is known by every demon

92
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:00,020
within a hundred miles.

93
00:07:01,030 --> 00:07:02,959
Stone Mountain God, you flatter me.

94
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,320
As a snake hunter,

95
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:05,980
you do have some skill.

96
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:07,600
Why turn to banditry?

97
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:10,839
The deities and the officials
left me no way to survive.

98
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:13,300
As a commoner,
I had no choice but to kill them

99
00:07:14,730 --> 00:07:16,330
and seek a way to live.

100
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,799
This is the nature of a demon!

101
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,600
Xu Ying,

102
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:23,080
your demonic instincts are hard to tame.

103
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,719
Look at the Stone Mountain God.

104
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,719
He has been tamed so well.

105
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,760
Lord Wei,

106
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:32,119
you're a lackey of the Zhou family,
and I'm a lackey of the Phantom Realm.

107
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,200
We are no different from each other.

108
00:07:38,450 --> 00:07:40,380
The Phantom River is still rising.

109
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:42,140
Get on the roof.

110
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,680
Do you two know

111
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:48,639
what caused the Phantom River

112
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,840
to change its course?

113
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:51,200
I don't know.

114
00:07:51,409 --> 00:07:53,289
I only know that countless people
must have died upstream

115
00:07:53,290 --> 00:07:55,658
when the Phantom River
changed its course.

116
00:07:55,659 --> 00:07:57,300
If the river keeps rising,

117
00:07:57,610 --> 00:08:00,010
this place will be flooded
sooner or later.

118
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,880
Dawn will break in less than 2 hours.

119
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:07,760
By then, the Phantom River
will naturally disappear.

120
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,160
Look!

121
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:13,099
The ghosts are all surging
toward that well.

122
00:08:13,100 --> 00:08:16,100
It seems something inside the well
is drawing them in.

123
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:36,959
It's that bell in the pavilion
in the backyard.

124
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,760
It seems

125
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:41,210
the bell is suppressing
whatever is inside the well.

126
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:50,629
I never thought this ruined temple

127
00:08:50,630 --> 00:08:52,519
would possess such a precious treasure.

128
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:53,399
But

129
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:55,799
why would such a treasure
be hung here?

130
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,560
Yuan,

131
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,519
do you think it would be safe
to hide inside this bell?

132
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,040
Well...

133
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:01,640
You truly are a genius.

134
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:16,920
What exactly

135
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:19,050
is being sealed beneath this well?

136
00:09:43,070 --> 00:09:45,270
My body won't obey me...

137
00:09:46,220 --> 00:09:50,260
The monster in the well
is controlling my body.

138
00:09:57,620 --> 00:09:58,540
A coffin.

139
00:10:17,710 --> 00:10:19,310
The ghosts are running wild.

140
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:21,200
Can this bell hold out?

141
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:28,710
Luckily...

142
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,360
What kind of monster is this?

143
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:41,560
This is...

144
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:42,930
a Phantom Deity!

145
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:46,760
A Phantom Deity that has lived
for at least 10,000 years.

146
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,559
This Phantom Deity is after the bell!

147
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,360
Oh no!

148
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:13,680
Get away!

149
00:11:15,650 --> 00:11:18,450
I hope this giant bell
can hold out a little longer.

150
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:34,840
It's so slow.

151
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:38,119
If I used it to smash
those deities chasing us,

152
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,850
I could flatten them one by one.

153
00:11:58,760 --> 00:11:59,560
Get away!

154
00:11:59,810 --> 00:12:01,340
All of you, get away from me!

155
00:12:03,180 --> 00:12:03,980
Yuan Qi!

156
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:44,639
Perhaps the Phantom River's
change of course was no coincidence.

157
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:47,169
Someone may have caused
a massive death toll

158
00:12:47,170 --> 00:12:49,929
just to free whatever lies
inside the coffin in the well.

159
00:12:49,930 --> 00:12:51,420
Who exactly is buried

160
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,200
inside that coffin?

161
00:13:13,900 --> 00:13:15,300
Why did this bell run off?

162
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:41,300
With such a commotion,

163
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:45,650
whoever is inside the coffin
must be something truly dreadful.

164
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:50,440
Yuan,

165
00:13:50,530 --> 00:13:51,519
I hear roosters crowing.

166
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:52,650
Dawn is almost here.

167
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,360
Where am I?

168
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:25,160
Am I still alive?

169
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,680
Where is that giant bell?

170
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,820
Where are those towering giants?

171
00:15:31,900 --> 00:15:34,310
[Qi cultivator: Qing Bi]

172
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,360
I never thought

173
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:41,620
that after sleeping for 3,000 years,

174
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:45,250
the first person I'd see upon waking
would be you.

175
00:15:48,310 --> 00:15:50,190
Who's speaking? Is that you?

176
00:15:54,670 --> 00:15:56,400
Perhaps this is for the best...

177
00:16:14,710 --> 00:16:16,809
So the thing sealed beneath this well

178
00:16:16,810 --> 00:16:18,090
really did escape.

179
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:21,720
She's quite beautiful, though.

180
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:23,870
Too bad she's a ghost...

181
00:16:24,530 --> 00:16:26,570
and she talks in such a strange way.

182
00:16:26,880 --> 00:16:29,280
Her aura is incredibly powerful.

183
00:16:29,610 --> 00:16:30,570
Xu Ying.

184
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,400
Xu Ying,

185
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,600
I've lost a leg.

186
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:54,380
If you leave this snake demon behind
and escape on your own,

187
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,530
I won't be able to catch you.

188
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:59,120
How could I leave

189
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:00,879
when my friend is unconscious?

190
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:01,680
Your friend?

191
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:04,599
You consider a snake demon your friend?

192
00:17:05,079 --> 00:17:06,999
He didn't abandon me
when I was in danger,

193
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
so I won't abandon him either.

194
00:17:09,569 --> 00:17:11,099
Let's finish this quickly.

195
00:17:20,990 --> 00:17:22,389
What incredible strength!

196
00:17:22,390 --> 00:17:23,710
Is he really human?

197
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,049
His swordsmanship is impressive.

198
00:17:30,050 --> 00:17:32,199
I'll have to take his weapon away first.

199
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:32,880
Kill!

200
00:17:49,810 --> 00:17:51,929
His strength is extraordinary.

201
00:17:51,930 --> 00:17:53,330
I can't take him head-on.

202
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:58,680
So fast!

203
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:06,350
Let's see where you can run!

204
00:18:08,770 --> 00:18:10,430
What a troublesome opponent.

205
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:18,639
You think taking my blade away

206
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:20,269
means I can't do anything to you?

207
00:18:20,270 --> 00:18:21,070
You brat,

208
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,120
I'll tear you apart

209
00:18:23,380 --> 00:18:26,060
and break your bones one by one.

210
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:41,280
I'll crush you!

211
00:18:43,300 --> 00:18:44,319
Damn it!

212
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:45,720
You're asking for death!

213
00:18:46,070 --> 00:18:47,600
Let's see where you can run!

214
00:18:54,790 --> 00:18:56,190
What a huge yellow hound.

215
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:57,999
Keep talking tough.

216
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:00,260
You'll be begging for mercy soon enough.

217
00:19:03,420 --> 00:19:04,500
Come on, hound.

218
00:19:04,980 --> 00:19:06,380
You're asking for death.

219
00:19:06,930 --> 00:19:07,919
Old beast,

220
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:10,560
the fur on your body
should fetch a good price.

221
00:19:13,970 --> 00:19:15,330
What a vicious beast.

222
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:25,780
And there's also a Nuo Shaman.

223
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:43,280
This guy can take a beating.

224
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:45,680
It'll take some effort to deal with him.

225
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:47,479
Fighting three against one

226
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,940
puts me at a disadvantage.

227
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,280
Brat,

228
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:54,000
you're lucky this time.

229
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,400
Still alive and well, are you,

230
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:33,430
[In the next episode]

231
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:30,080
little ant Xu Ying?

232
00:20:32,430 --> 00:20:33,959
This is a little troublesome.

233
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:34,960
Come, come, come.

234
00:20:35,050 --> 00:20:36,959
I finally get to settle the score
for that poison.

235
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,819
Watch how I'll win you over with kindness.

236
00:20:38,820 --> 00:20:39,380
Yuan,

237
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:40,520
hold on for now.

238
00:20:40,760 --> 00:20:43,090
I'll find a way to counter this technique.

239
00:20:43,810 --> 00:20:46,470
Characters from tens of thousands
of years ago.

240
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:50,800
I-It's... still alive!

